        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starlit Bottle</strong> is a cozy and relaxing casual game designed to relieve stress. Its core gameplay is simple yet incredibly soothing: your goal is to pour water of different colors from bottles into separate cups until each bottle contains only one color of water to complete a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three difficulty modes—Easy, Medium, and Hard—catering to players with different paces. As you progress through the challenges, the number of bottles you need to sort will gradually increase. Whether you want to unwind after a long day or enjoy low-stress puzzles during short breaks, this game is perfect for you.</p>",
